cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these scripts, please cite them as below."

title: "cordex-fps-remap: remapping CORDEX-FPSCONV model output onto a common grid"
abstract: >-
  Command-line scripts for remapping CORDEX-FPSCONV convection-permitting model
  (CPM) and driving regional climate model (RCM) output onto a common regular
  latitude/longitude grid over the Greater Alpine Region. The scripts inspect the
  native grid metadata of each model, build the source-grid description that CDO
  requires, harmonise units, merge the files of each model, and apply first-order
  conservative remapping with CDO.

